# Line endings are part of this build's output, so git must not be free to change them.
#
# _tools/build.mjs writes a cache-busting hash of each stylesheet and script into every page that loads
# it (assets/css/styles.css?v=8bd623f3). The hash is taken over the file's BYTES ON DISK, so a file that
# git checks out with CRLF hashes differently from the same file with LF, and the pages that reference it
# would differ between this machine, CI and Cloudflare's build.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.avif binary
*.webp binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
*.mp4 binary
